        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Doll, slim kid leather body with carved and painted wooden head, lower arms and legs. Bands of red paper around leg join between wood and leather. Painted green flat-soled slippers. Wearing a pale yellow striped silk day dress with tight bodice and long sleeves, with a matching shoulder cape. Fully lined white cotton. Bonnet trimmed with artificial flowers and leaves and lace. White silk handkerchief edged with lace. Petticoat of white lawn, over a heavily-stiffened cotton hip petticoat and a long glazed cotton chemise."@en ;
